WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:03.752
Unit twenty-three. Mosquito-Borne Diseases!

2
00:00:04.686 --> 00:00:08.554
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.604 --> 00:00:11.728
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:15.367
Today we learn about Mosquito-Borne Diseases. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.247
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

6
00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:26.429
Malaria. Say it with me. Malaria!

7
00:00:30.003 --> 00:00:33.436
Zika. Say it with me. Zika!

8
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.000
Vector. Say it with me. Vector!

9
00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:47.407
Breeding site. Say it with me. Breeding site!

10
00:00:50.927 --> 00:00:54.210
Repellent. Say it with me. Repellent!

11
00:00:57.694 --> 00:01:00.811
Net. Say it with me. Net!

12
00:01:04.253 --> 00:01:08.119
Symptoms. Say it with me. Symptoms!

13
00:01:11.659 --> 00:01:20.204
Dengue, malaria, and Zika are spread by a mosquito vector. Removing each breeding site, using repellent and nets, and recognising symptoms early reduce harm.

14
00:01:20.254 --> 00:01:23.102
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.578 --> 00:01:29.478
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.528 --> 00:01:30.678
Zika!

17
00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:36.373
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.422 --> 00:01:37.573
Net!

19
00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:43.870
Did you know? Malaria is caused by a parasite, while dengue and Zika are caused by viruses!

20
00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.008
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.359 --> 00:01:55.131
Think and answer. Why is removing breeding sites a community job?

22
00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.331
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.295 --> 00:02:01.791
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.841 --> 00:02:04.334
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

